# ============================================================
# Interview prep — kept LOCAL only, never push
# ============================================================
# These docs contain personal interview prep:
#   - CONCEPTS.md has "Likely Interview Questions" with prepared answers
#   - SUBMISSION.md has the Loom script + submission email template
#   - TESTING.md has "Forcing a Low Score" — looks like gaming the demo
#   - AI_DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md reveals AI-heavy build + retrospective
# Keep these for your own use; do NOT show to the interviewer.
docs/CONCEPTS.md
docs/SUBMISSION.md
docs/TESTING.md
docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md

